{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51946","headline":"过水坪 · 吕岩","name":"过水坪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山巅云起日初辰，山径霜清绝点尘。\n林下支锅炊饭客，道旁背笼贩盐人。\n白崖岭峻藏风洞，碧涧泉音露石垠。\n跋涉不知残腊尽，动劳宁复计冬春。\n（以上《古今图书集成·职方典》一一六二《郧阳府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}